      "writtenOn": "2018-09-12T10:03:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The IT8320 doesn\u0027t have r16-r19, because the option of “reduced register configuration.”\nSo the total number of general registers is 16.\nPlease take a look at \"Table- 4 Registers for Reduced Register Configuration\".",
